      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HIGH GEAR MARIA (1) turned in a better run last time to find a minor placing (22.27) at this track behind Blazing Starline in a Grade 5. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Some good form is emerging from her last run. Can go on with it. INFRASONIC (2) turned in a solid run last start over 380m at this track finishing 4th and beaten only 4.5 lengths (22.52). The form from his last run is stacking up nicely. Should be about the money. HARA'S JADE (3) boasts a strong record this course with two wins and three minors from six tries. Comes off a (22.44) win last time, scoring by half a length in a Grade 6 over 380m at this track. Suited here and expected to run well. SALLY SAID (6) must be included in calculations.",
